88%90%EF%BC%8C%E5%8F%AF%E4%BB%A5%E7%BB%99%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E5%85%83%E7%B4%A0%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%EF%BC%8C%E4%BD%86%E9%80%9A%E7%94%A8%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%8D%E5%A6%82%E8%82%9D%E7%89%A9%E3%80%90%E5%A4%AA%E8%99%9A%E4%B9%8B%E6%8F%A1%E3%80%91%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1632715320904\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\" contenteditable=\"false\" draggable=\"true\" data-empty-text=\"\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"role\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--role obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>适用角色</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__role-table\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\"><div class=\"role-icon-td\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/27/75940953/fcd54fef75c29fa33caaaadf573c943e_3324866743631751749.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>炽翎</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon obc-tmpl__rate-icon--inactive\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">作为主C时炽翎可选的毕业武器，但是缺乏辅助能力。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/75940953/e1c1eb0589973ba6a65a185cb35dd1e4_6883578481157361538.gif\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">炽翎的前输出向毕业武器，现版本地位不佳</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">为炽翎提供额外300%倍率的火伤，能一定程度上弥补伤害方面的短板，还能提供40秒一次的屏障，对于某些高难环境有一定的帮助</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">自身拥有少量全元素伤害加成，可以给其他元素角色使用，但通用性不如肝物【太虚之握】</p></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc-gif\" style=\"padding: 0px;\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2021/09/10/75940953/e1c1eb0589973ba6a65a185cb35dd1e4_6883578481157361538.gif\" alt=\"\"></div></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
